rm to find out what happened. After hearing the details of the attack, you realized that it sounded familiar to another attack that happened a few months back. The police managed to arrest one of the criminal responsible for it but they failed to arrest his partners. Luckily you know someone in the police department so you asked your intern to gather evidence from the victim's computer while you meet your friend to see if he could give you any evidence they got from the captured criminal's computer. After collecting the evidence, you realized that your intern has done a teribble job at acquisition and missed out a lot of potentially important forensics artifacts. Could you still find out what happened?.</p>\n<p>Download the artifacts from : <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uZKu7_eFSJxJb9RJfj94bchoDHzyPkck/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uZKu7_eFSJxJb9RJfj94bchoDHzyPkck/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Password: sEzXzWyqRt95ASRH</p>\n<p>Notes:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>All malwares found in this challenge are working malware. DO NOT RUN IT ON YOUR HOST COMPUTER, USE A SANDBOX/VM. I am not responsible for any damages on your computer.</li>\n<li>{12b27ea2-0101-4435-a4af-5a8743ce345f} is the evidence from the criminal's computer while {f1733278-c744-4bf0-9b9a-b1dfb278f4bf} is from the victim's computer</li>\n<li>Unless specified otherwise, for questions needing multiple answers, the order of the answer you provide does not matter.</li>\n</ol>\n</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"challenge-bottom-section\">\n\n          <div class=\"challenge-connection-section mb-3\">\n            \n<h6 class=\"fw-semibold mb-0\">Connection Info</h6>\n<div class=\"deployment-actions mt-2\" data-challenge-id=\"1\">\n  <div class=\"challenge-connection-box\">\n    <div class=\"container-status\" id=\"deployment-info\">\n      <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2 text-muted\">\n        <div class=\"spinner-border spinner-border-sm\" role=\"status\"></div>\n        <span>Loading instance status...</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"container-actions d-flex align-items-stretch gap-2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n    <button\n      onclick=\"container_request(1)\"\n      class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm auth-submit-button instance-launch-button d-none\"\n      id=\"create-chal\"\n    >\n      <span><i class=\"fas fa-play me-1\"></i> Launch Instance</span>\n    </button>\n    <button\n      onclick=\"container_renew(1)\"\n      class=\"btn btn-sm instance-extend-button d-none\"\n      id=\"extend-chal\"\n    >\n      <span><i class=\"fas fa-clock me-1\"></i> Extend</span>\n    </button>\n    <button\n      onclick=\"container_stop(1)\"\n      class=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm d-none px-0\"\n      style=\"aspect-ratio:1\"\n      id=\"terminate-chal\"\n    >\n      <i class=\"fas fa-stop\"></i>\n    </button>\n    <button\n      onclick=\"container_cancel_queue()\"\n      class=\"btn btn-danger btn-sm d-none\"\n      id=\"exit-queue\"\n    >\n      <i class=\"fas fa-sign-out-alt me-1\"></i> Exit from queue\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\nconsole.log(\"[Container INLINE] connection_info block script executing\");\nconsole.log(\"[Container INLINE] Challenge ID: 1\");\nif (typeof view_container_info === 'function') {\n    console.log(\"[Container INLINE] Calling view_container_info\");\n    view_container_info(1);\n} else {\n    console.log(\"[Container INLINE] view_container_info not defined yet, setting timeout\");\n    setTimeout(function() {\n        if (typeof view_container_info === 'function') {\n            console.log(\"[Container INLINE] Calling view_container_info after timeout\");\n            view_container_info(1);\n        } else {\n            console.error(\"[Container INLINE] view_container_info still not defined!\");\n        }\n    }, 500);\n}\n</script>\n\n          </div>\n\n          \n\n          <template x-if=\"max_attempts > 0\">\n            <p>\n              <span x-text=\"attempts\"></span>/<span x-text=\"max_attempts\"></span> attempts\n            </p>\n          </template>\n\n          <div class=\"row submit-row\">\n            <div class=\"col pe-0\">\n              \n                <input\n                    id=\"challenge-id\" class=\"challenge-id\" type=\"hidden\"\n                    value=\"1\"\n                >\n                <input\n                    id=\"challenge-input\" class=\"challenge-input form-control\" style=\"font-family: var(--bs-font-monospace)\"\n                    type=\"text\" name=\"submission\"\n                    @keyup.enter=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                    placeholder=\"COMPFEST18{[A-z0-9_-]+}\" x-model=\"submission\"\n                >\n              \n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-auto mt-3 mt-sm-0 key-submit\">\n              \n                <button\n                    id=\"challenge-submit\"\n                    class=\"challenge-submit auth-submit-button btn btn-primary h-100\" type=\"submit\"\n                    @click.debounce.500ms=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                >\n                  <span>Submit</span>\n                </button>\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row notification-row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n              <template x-if=\"response\">\n                <div class=\"alert text-center w-100 mt-3\"\n                    :class=\"{\n                      'alert-success': response.data.status == 'correct',\n                      'alert-info': response.data.status == 'already_solved',\n                      'alert-danger': response.data.status == 'incorrect',\n                      'alert-warning': response.data.status == 'paused',\n                    }\" role=\"alert\"\n                >\n                  <strong x-text=\"response.data.message\"></strong>\n                  <div x-show=\"(response.data.status == 'correct' || response.data.status == 'already_solved')\">\n                    <div x-show=\"getNextId()\">\n                      <button @click=\"nextChallenge()\" class=\"btn btn-info mt-3\">\n                        Next Challenge\n                      </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <div>\n                      <button x-show=\"!share_url\" @click=\"getShareUrl()\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-info mt-3\">\n                        Share\n                      </button>\n                      <div class=\"btn-group mt-3\" role=\"group\" x-show=\"share_url\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" @click=\"copyShareUrl()\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"Copied!\">\n                          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-copy\"></i>\n                        </button>\n                        <a :href=\"'https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                          <i class=\"fa-brands fa-twitter\"></i>\n                        </a>\n                        <a :href=\"'https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                          <i class=\"fa-brands fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n                        </a>\n                        <a :href=\"'http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                          <i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin-in\"></i>\n                        </a>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n\n                    \n                    <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                      <hr>\n                      <div class=\"text-center\">\n                        <p class=\"mb-2\">Rate this challenge:</p>\n                        <div class=\"rating-buttons mb-2\" x-init=\"selectedRating = ratingValue || 0;\">\n                          <button \n                            class=\"btn btn-outline-success me-2\" \n                            :class=\"{ 'active': selectedRating === 1 }\"\n                            @click=\"selectedRating = 1\"\n                          >\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-thumbs-up\"></i>\n                          </button>\n                          <button \n                            class=\"btn btn-outline-danger\" \n                            :class=\"{ 'active': selectedRating === -1 }\"\n                            @click=\"selectedRating = -1\"\n                          >\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-thumbs-down\"></i>\n                          </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                          <textarea \n                            class=\"form-control\" \n                            rows=\"2\" \n                            x-model=\"ratingReview\"\n                            placeholder=\"Write a review (optional)\"\n                            maxlength=\"2000\"\n                          ></textarea>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                          <button \n                            @click=\"submitRating()\"\n                            class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n                            :disabled=\"!selectedRating\"\n                          >\n                            Submit\n                          </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div x-show=\"ratingSubmitted\" class=\"text-success mt-2\">\n                          <small>Thank you for your rating!</small>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </template>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          \n          \n\n          \n          <div x-show=\"getSolutionId()\" class=\"mt-3\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" @click=\"showSolution()\" x-show=\"!solutionVisible\">\n              View Solution\n            </button>\n            <div x-show=\"solutionVisible\" x-cloak>\n              <h6 class=\"mt-3\">Solution</h6>\n              <template x-if=\"solution\">\n                <div x-html=\"solution\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"></div>\n              </template>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        \n        <div class=\"challenge-solves-col\" :class=\"{ 'is-collapsed': solvesCollapsed }\">\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary challenge-solves-toggle\"\n            @click=\"toggleSolves()\"\n            :aria-expanded=\"(!solvesCollapsed).toString()\"\n            aria-controls=\"challenge-solves-list\"\n            :aria-label=\"solvesCollapsed ? 'Expand solves panel' : 'Collapse solves panel'\"\n            :title=\"solvesCollapsed ? 'Expand solves panel' : 'Collapse solves panel'\"\n          >\n            <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"challenge-solves-clip\" id=\"challenge-solves-list\" :aria-hidden=\"solvesCollapsed.toString()\">\n            <div class=\"challenge-solves-content\">\n              <div class=\"challenge-solves-header\">\n                <h6 class=\"mb-0 challenge-solves-title\">\n                  0 Solves\n                </h6>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"challenge-solves-list\">\n                <table class=\"table table-sm align-middle\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Name</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                 